<title>UK: MOTORCYCLING-BRITISH GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-BRITISH GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>DONINGTON PARK, England 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in</p>
<p>Friday's first official practice session for Sunday's 500cc</p>
<p>British motorcycle Grand Prix.</p>
<p>1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda One minute 33.579 seconds</p>
<p>(lap 25 out of 26, average speed 154.765 kph)</p>
<p> 2. Doriano Romboni (Italy) Aprilia	     1:33.807</p>
<p> 3. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda		    1:33.873</p>
<p> 4. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda		  1:33.907</p>
<p> 5. Jean-Michel Bayle (France) Modenas KR3    1:34.353</p>
<p> 6. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda		    1:34.356</p>
<p> 7. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha		  1:34.388</p>
<p> 8. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda		   1:34.423</p>
